    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Agent No. 6 is an unreleased first-person shooter straight from the 90s. Step in the shoes of a legendary secret agent, codename 'SIX', and bring down a dangerous terrorist organization. Find out what they are planning, where to find them, and how to stop them. What might seem like an ordinary game, takes a dark turn when something else is present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game provides a surreal experience that may have upsetting themes. While resembling a simple 90s-shooter, it is much more. Please play at your discretion.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Agent No. 6 brings you to various worldwide locations. The game is divided into multiple chapters. Chapters contain several unique missions, each requiring its own strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing a mission, a grade reflects how the mission went. The mission can be replayed at any time on various difficulties. Can you complete each mission with an A+ rating?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447750/extras/018dba49e80bf820e7f35ba0a94f2c1e.poster.avif?t=1728983167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447750/extras/018dba49e80bf820e7f35ba0a94f2c1e.webm?t=1728983167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447750/extras/018dba49e80bf820e7f35ba0a94f2c1e.mp4?t=1728983167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom loadouts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 30+ unlockable equipment in the game. Each equipment is unique, ranging from weaponry to explosives, to crazy weirdness. Because of this, each weapon may open up a unique strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each mission, you are allowed to bring two unique equipment. As the difficulty may rise throughout the game, different loadout combinations shall be essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447750/extras/6581cc3b06e8e55160644ccc70a8577c.avif?t=1728983167\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stealth or guns-blazing.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Agent No. 6 introduces various enemy types. These enemies may range from simple guards to heavily armed machine gunners. Each enemy may require a different strategy. Combined with the unique variety of missions, strategies may range from stealth to full-on guns-blazing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the d!fficulty may rise, it may be important to el!minate enemies before they are given the chance to fight back. $tay quiet, distract enemIes, destr0y cameras, and h!de wHen ncessAry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447750/extras/867c2ef97e649f18e31bc875371df236.poster.avif?t=1728983167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447750/extras/867c2ef97e649f18e31bc875371df236.webm?t=1728983167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447750/extras/867c2ef97e649f18e31bc875371df236.mp4?t=1728983167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges and cheat codes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the game, a set of challenges are unlocked. Completing challenges may unlock cheat codes that can freely be u$ed During miss!0nS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >w%p6 b#yx*$ d@H#dK fEwdvv, @jk6L&amp;n n@#Pc fdv$ ^M#lg pey *6 dyEq k#@ig}<i>b riv&amp;r rc#n e$rmk</i> vq#$g w*d &amp;#prx{qc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447750/extras/726552b462f1be764e3a6cae757bca16.avif?t=1728983167\" /></span></p>",
